    "rich_text_HYxDYE": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "name": "Rich text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "Why Kickers Love This Net",
        "content": "<p>The Extra Point Kicking Net is trusted by athletes and coaches across all levels of football because it delivers what serious players need most: performance, durability, and efficiency. Built with heavy-duty materials and engineered for repetition, this backyard football net helps players maximize reps and reduce downtime. The instant ball return system means fewer interruptions between kicks during warm-ups, live practices, or focused solo drills. </p><p>With thousands of uses logged by NFL & NCAA teams, high schools, and trainers, it’s widely considered one of the best football kicking nets available today. No matter if you're training for field goals, punts, or extra point practice, this is the kicking training net designed to deliver results.</p><h2>Portable and Easy to Set Up</h2><p>No tools. No hassle. The Extra Point Kicking Net features The Net Return’s Quick Color Connect System™, a smart, intuitive assembly system that allows you to set up or take down the net in under five minutes. Each tube is color-coded and click-connects securely, making this football kicking net setup a breeze whether you're on the field, at home, or between games. </p><p>Weighing just 45 pounds, it’s light enough to carry but sturdy enough for repeated kicks and punts. The net packs easily into a rugged wheeled duffle bag, perfect for players and coaches who need a portable football net that travels well and holds up season after season.</p><h2>Train Anywhere – Field or Backyard</h2><p>This extra point football net is versatile enough to fit a variety of training spaces. Use it on the practice field, in a gym, or set it up in your driveway or backyard for after-hours reps. The compact footprint makes it well suited for both indoor and outdoor use, while its weather-resistant construction ensures year-round reliability. </p><p>Whether you’re a solo kicker working in a garage or a part of a team warming up on the sideline, this portable football net can always be relied on to support your practice sessions. It’s the ideal practice net for football players looking to train more often in more places.</p><h2>Built for All Skill Levels</h2><p>From youth leagues to professional football teams, this kicker practice net supports development at every level. Private coaches love it for its versatility and speed of setup, while parents appreciate how it enables practicing football at home without the need for a full field. It’s a valuable addition to any football training program—it doesn’t matter if you’re just starting with field goal kicking or refining high-level punting technique. </p><p>Used by high schools, collegiate teams, and national programs alike, this American football kicking net is more than just gear—it’s foundational football equipment for kickers and long snappers who want to train smarter, longer, and more effectively.</p>",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_link": "",
