    "accordion_content_6jzpCi": {
      "type": "accordion-content",
      "blocks": {
        "item_KDVMyH": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why make an Extra Point Net?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>The Extra Point Kicking Net was developed to meet a real need in football kicking practice—a net designed specifically for kickers, punters, and long snappers. Most nets on the market are generic and can’t withstand the repetitive impact of focused kicker practice. This extra point net is built for serious training, offering automatic ball return, elite durability, and a compact, portable size. It’s an excellent accessory for anyone looking to improve their punting or field goal kicking without needing a full field or catching partner.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "item_BH4ByK": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where can I use the Extra Point Net?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>The Extra Point Net is engineered for total versatility—use it on the practice field, in the backyard, your garage, or even in a large indoor gym. Its compact size and portability make it an ideal solution for athletes who want to train year-round without needing a full team facility. With our <a href=\"https://www.thenetreturn.com/products/outdoor-cover\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Outdoor Cover</span></a>, you can even leave your net outside without fear of adverse weather conditions.</p><p>Other suitable training environments include:</p><ul><li>Sideline warm-up areas during games</li><li>Indoor sports facilities or turf domes</li><li>School parking lots or blacktops</li><li>College recreation centers and field houses</li><li>Rooftops or urban settings with limited space</li></ul><p>No matter where you set it up, this football net for backyard and field use helps you get in meaningful reps. It’s one of the best options available for a solo kicker net setup that delivers real results.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "item_hV3Gax": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the Extra Point Net easy to install?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>Yes—setup is quick, intuitive, and completely tool-free. Thanks to the Quick Color Connect System™, each frame piece is color-coded and clicks into place in under five minutes. You don’t need tools, extra hands, or a long instruction manual. </p><p>Whether you're a coach setting up a net for extra point practice or a busy parent helping your little athlete train in the backyard, it could hardly be easier to set up this equipment. The compact frame and durable design also means that it’s easy to disassemble and store—another reason why it's one of the most user-friendly football practice nets on the market.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "item_kUFatN": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer free shipping on the Extra Point Net?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>Yes! All Extra Point Football Net orders over $650 qualify for free ground shipping within the continental U.S. That includes everything you need for a complete, portable kicking net football setup—perfect for personal use or team training. We believe serious kicker practice net tools should be both accessible and reliable, and we aim to make that experience seamless from order to delivery. Get your field goal practice net without extra fees or complicated logistics, and start training smarter from your backyard, garage, or wherever you want to set up.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "item_MMni7D": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who is the Extra Point Net best for?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>The Extra Point Net is built for a wide range of athletes. It’s a fantastic piece of equipment for youth football players just learning their form, high school and college kickers sharpening their accuracy, and coaches or parents supporting skill development at home. This football practice net is also trusted by private instructors working with serious recruits and specialists. </p><p>From developing fundamentals to preparing for competitive play, it’s the most dependable kicking and punting net in its class. If you're looking for the best football kicking net for performance, portability, and long-term value, this one checks every box.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
